  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Securing the rights of minorities and people affected by caste-based discrimination in four states of India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To protect and promote the rights of minorities and those affected by caste-based discrimination.Specific objective: To enhance access to justice and basic services for minorities and people affected by caste-based discrimination in four states of India through advocacy, capacity building and community-led monitoring of laws and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
